a-start=\\\"3077\\\" data-end=\\\"3130\\\">C\\u00f3 kinh nghi\\u1ec7m build SPA\\/SSR (Nuxt\\/Next l\\u00e0 l\\u1ee3i th\\u1ebf)<\\/p>\\n<\\/li>\\n \\t<li data-start=\\\"3131\\\" data-end=\\\"3173\\\">\\n<p data-start=\\\"3133\\\" data-end=\\\"3173\\\">Bi\\u1ebft t\\u1ed1i \\u01b0u responsive &amp; cross-browser<\\/p>\\n<\\/li>\\n \\t<li data-start=\\\"3174\\\" data-end=\\\"3220\\\">\\n<p data-start=\\\"3176\\\" data-end=\\\"3220\\\">Bonus: UI animation, performance debugging<\\/p>\\n<\\/li>\\n<\\/ul>\",\"post_title\":\"Frontend Developer (Vue\\/React)\",\"post_excerpt\":\"\",\"post_status\":\"publish\",\"comment_status\":\"closed\",\"ping_status\":\"closed\",\"post_password\":\"\",\"post_name\":\"frontend-developer-vue-react\",\"to_ping\":\"\",\"pinged\":\"\",\"post_modified\":\"2025-11-21 08:43:21\",\"post_modified_gmt\":\"2025-11-21 08:43:21\",\"post_content_filtered\":\"\",\"post_parent\":0,\"guid\":\"http:\\/\\/localhost:8080\\/?post_type=job_listing&#038;p=987\",\"menu_order\":0,\"post_type\":\"job_listing\",\"post_mime_type\":\"\",\"comment_count\":\"0\",\"filter\":\"raw\"},{\"ID\":986,\"post_author\":\"1\",\"post_date\":\"2025-11-21 08:39:50\",\"post_date_gmt\":\"2025-11-21 08:39:50\",\"post_content\":\"<p data-start=\\\"224\\\" data-end=\\\"260\\\"><strong data-start=\\\"224\\\" data-end=\\\"237\\\">L\\u00e0m t\\u1eeb xa<\\/strong><\\/p>\\n<p data-start=\\\"262\\\" data-end=\\\"383\\\"><strong data-start=\\\"262\\\" data-end=\\\"274\\\">K\\u1ef9 n\\u0103ng:<\\/strong> PHP, Laravel, MySQL, Redis, Docker<br data-start=\\\"309\\\" data-end=\\\"312\\\" \\/><strong data-start=\\\"312\\\" data-end=\\\"327\\\">Chuy\\u00ean m\\u00f4n:<\\/strong> Backend Developer<br data-start=\\\"345\\\" data-end=\\\"348\\\" \\/><strong data-start=\\\"348\\\" data-end=\\\"361\\\">L\\u0129nh v\\u1ef1c:<\\/strong> D\\u1ecbch v\\u1ee5 &amp; T\\u01b0 v\\u1ea5n IT<\\/p>\\n\\n\\n<hr data-start=\\\"385\\\" data-end=\\\"388\\\" \\/>\\n\\n<h2 data-start=\\\"390\\\" data-end=\\\"424\\\"><st