sting\",\"post_mime_type\":\"\",\"comment_count\":\"0\",\"filter\":\"raw\"},{\"ID\":1000,\"post_author\":\"1\",\"post_date\":\"2025-11-21 09:04:48\",\"post_date_gmt\":\"2025-11-21 09:04:48\",\"post_content\":\"<p data-start=\\\"2705\\\" data-end=\\\"2824\\\"><strong data-start=\\\"2705\\\" data-end=\\\"2717\\\">K\\u1ef9 n\\u0103ng:<\\/strong> Tuy\\u1ec3n d\\u1ee5ng, \\u0110\\u00e0o t\\u1ea1o, Employee Engagement<br data-start=\\\"2758\\\" data-end=\\\"2761\\\" \\/><strong data-start=\\\"2761\\\" data-end=\\\"2776\\\">Chuy\\u00ean m\\u00f4n:<\\/strong> Nh\\u00e2n s\\u1ef1<br data-start=\\\"2784\\\" data-end=\\\"2787\\\" \\/><strong data-start=\\\"2787\\\" data-end=\\\"2800\\\">L\\u0129nh v\\u1ef1c:<\\/strong> Ng\\u00e2n h\\u00e0ng \\/ V\\u0103n ph\\u00f2ng<\\/p>\\n\\n\\n<hr data-start=\\\"2826\\\" data-end=\\\"2829\\\" \\/>\\n\\n<h2 data-start=\\\"2831\\\" data-end=\\\"2853\\\"><strong data-start=\\\"2834\\\" data-end=\\\"2853\\\">M\\u00f4 t\\u1ea3 c\\u00f4ng vi\\u1ec7c<\\/strong><\\/h2>\\n<ul data-start=\\\"2854\\\" data-end=\\\"3079\\\">\\n \\t<li data-start=\\\"2854\\\" data-end=\\\"2902\\\">\\n<p data-start=\\\"2856\\\" data-end=\\\"2902\\\">Th\\u1ef1c hi\\u1ec7n tuy\\u1ec3n d\\u1ee5ng, onboarding nh\\u00e2n s\\u1ef1 m\\u1edbi<\\/p>\\n<\\/li>\\n \\t<li data-start=\\\"2903\\\" data-end=\\\"2950\\\">\\n<p data-start=\\\"2905\\\" data-end=\\\"2950\\\">Qu\\u1ea3n l\\u00fd h\\u1ed3 s\\u01a1, ch\\u00ednh s\\u00e1ch, quy \\u0111\\u1ecbnh nh\\u00e2n s\\u1ef1<\\/p>\\n<\\/li>\\n \\t<li data-start=\\\"2951\\\" data-end=\\\"3020\\\">\\n<p data-start=\\\"2953\\\" data-end=\\\"3020\\\">H\\u1ed7 tr\\u1ee3 t\\u1ed5 ch\\u1ee9c ch\\u01b0\\u01a1ng tr\\u00ecnh \\u0111\\u00e0o t\\u1ea1o, team building, HR activities<\\/p>\\n<\\/li>\\n \\t<li data-start=\\\"3021\\\" data-end=\\\"3079\\\">\\n<p data-start=\\\"3023\\\" data-end=\\\"3079\\\">Theo d\\u00f5i ch\\u1ea5m c\\u00f4ng, l\\u01b0\\u01a1ng th\\u01b0\\u1edfng v\\u00e0 ph\\u00fac l\\u1ee3i nh\\u00e2n vi\\u00ean<\\/p>\\n<\\/li>\\n<\\