1t nghi\\u1ec7p CNTT\\/\\u0110i\\u1ec7n t\\u1eed\\/Vi\\u1ec5n th\\u00f4ng ho\\u1eb7c ng\\u00e0nh li\\u00ean quan.<\\/p>\\n<\\/li>\\n \\t<li data-start=\\\"1229\\\" data-end=\\\"1283\\\">\\n<p data-start=\\\"1231\\\" data-end=\\\"1283\\\">3+ n\\u0103m kinh nghi\\u1ec7m C\\/C++ tr\\u00ean Linux ho\\u1eb7c h\\u1ec7 nh\\u00fang.<\\/p>\\n<\\/li>\\n \\t<li data-start=\\\"1284\\\" data-end=\\\"1312\\\">\\n<p data-start=\\\"1286\\\" data-end=\\\"1312\\\">Ti\\u1ebfng Anh giao ti\\u1ebfp t\\u1ed1t.<\\/p>\\n<\\/li>\\n \\t<li data-start=\\\"1313\\\" data-end=\\\"1361\\\">\\n<p data-start=\\\"1315\\\" data-end=\\\"1361\\\">T\\u1ef1 ch\\u1ee7 trong c\\u00f4ng vi\\u1ec7c, gi\\u1ea3i quy\\u1ebft v\\u1ea5n \\u0111\\u1ec1 t\\u1ed1t.<\\/p>\\n<\\/li>\\n<\\/ul>\\n<p data-start=\\\"1363\\\" data-end=\\\"1392\\\"><strong data-start=\\\"1363\\\" data-end=\\\"1390\\\">Technical Requirements:<\\/strong><\\/p>\\n\\n<ul data-start=\\\"1393\\\" data-end=\\\"1611\\\">\\n \\t<li data-start=\\\"1393\\\" data-end=\\\"1463\\\">\\n<p data-start=\\\"1395\\\" data-end=\\\"1463\\\">Th\\u00e0nh th\\u1ea1o C\\/C++, cross-compiling, debugging tool (gdb, valgrind).<\\/p>\\n<\\/li>\\n \\t<li data-start=\\\"1464\\\" data-end=\\\"1521\\\">\\n<p data-start=\\\"1466\\\" data-end=\\\"1521\\\">Hi\\u1ec3u c\\u1ea5u tr\\u00fac h\\u1ec7 nh\\u00fang, memory management, threading.<\\/p>\\n<\\/li>\\n \\t<li data-start=\\\"1522\\\" data-end=\\\"1568\\\">\\n<p data-start=\\\"1524\\\" data-end=\\\"1568\\\">Kinh nghi\\u1ec7m driver development l\\u00e0 l\\u1ee3i th\\u1ebf.<\\/p>\\n<\\/li>\\n \\t<li data-start=\\\"1569\\\" data-end=\\\"1611\\\">\\n<p data-start=\\\"1571\\\" data-end=\\\"1611\\\">Bi\\u1ebft Python\\/Shell scripting l\\u00e0 m\\u1ed9t plus.<\\/p>\\n<\\/li>\\n<\\/ul>\",\"post_title\":\"Embedded Software Engineer (C\\/C++)\",\"post_excerpt\":\"\",\"post_status\":\"publish\",\"comment_status\":\"closed\",\"ping_status\":\"closed\",\"post_password\":\"\",\"post_name\":\"embedded-software-engineer-c-c\",\"to_ping\":\"\",\"pinged\":\"\",\"post_modified\":\"2025-11-21 08:48:03\",\"post_modified_gmt\":\"2025-11-21 08:48:03\",\"post_content_filtered\":\"\",\"post_parent\":0,\"guid\":\"http:\\/\\/localhost:8080\\/?post_type=job_listing&#038;p=989\",\"menu_order\":0,\"post_type\":\"job_listing\",\"post_mime_type\":\"\",\"comment_count\":\"0\",\"filter\":\"raw\"}],\"found_posts\":15,\"max_num_pages\":2}', 'off'),
